WEBVTT

00:14:59.483 --> 00:15:00.673
I want to say --

00:15:00.697 --> 00:15:03.284
just a little autobiographical moment --

00:15:03.308 --> 00:15:06.298
that I actually am married to a wife,

00:15:06.322 --> 00:15:08.273
and she's really quite wonderful.

00:15:08.297 --> 00:15:09.640
I couldn't have done better.

00:15:09.664 --> 00:15:11.229
I didn't settle.

00:15:11.253 --> 00:15:13.728
But settling isn't always
such a bad thing.

00:15:14.158 --> 00:15:15.308
Finally,

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:19.397
one consequence of buying
a bad-fitting pair of jeans

00:15:19.421 --> 00:15:21.607
when there is only one kind to buy

00:15:21.631 --> 00:15:25.352
is that when you are dissatisfied
and you ask why, who's responsible,

00:15:25.376 --> 00:15:27.769
the answer is clear:
the world is responsible.

00:15:27.793 --> 00:15:29.512
What could you do?

00:15:29.536 --> 00:15:32.534
When there are hundreds
of different styles of jeans available